    vann:example "ex:Practitioner martialis:hasRankAssertion martialis:assertion42 . martialis:assertion42 a martialis:RankAssertion ; martialis:rankStyle ex:Judo ; martialis:rankSystem ex:DanKyuSystem ; martialis:rankType rt:dan ; martialis:rankOrdinal 6 ; martialis:conferredBy ex:Kodokan ; martialis:grantedBy ex:TeacherX ."@en ;
